This book contains pictures of savagely looking people in loincloths. According to it, this island's inhabitants is quite savage people. They live in small tribes. They know what fire is, but can't make it. Each tribe carries fire in a wicker and worships it like an idol. Loss of fire is a great misfortune for those people. They communicate primarily by gestures. You keep turning the pages over, but soon its getting boring. You have to look something else.    